[00:00.000]...
[00:17.050]Spilled guts and glory
{"倾泻的胆识与荣光"}
[00:18.690]Urban Legend. I am that story
{"都市传说　我即是传奇"}
[00:21.020]It's the killer killers captain
{"这是杀手们的首领"}
[00:22.180]MP Anti-Personnel Control
{"反人员控制部队"}
[00:24.730]And I'm out of your control
{"而我已脱离你的掌控"}
[00:26.780]I just do what I know
{"我只遵循本能行事"}
[00:28.450]Do it Better than anyone I know
{"做得比所有熟识者更出色"}
[00:30.430]Let my body count speak for me
{"让我的战绩为我代言"}
[00:33.270]I see where puzzle pieces fit
{"我看透拼图的契合之处"}
[00:34.370]And got the ear of royalty
{"赢得王室的垂青"}
[00:36.950]From a royal bloodline
{"源自皇族血脉"}
[00:38.770]Strong as identity
{"坚如身份烙印"}
[00:40.960]Underground survivor
{"地下世界的幸存者"}
[00:42.250]Know how to stay alive
{"深谙生存之道"}
[00:44.060]Murder Urban Legend
{"凶案都市传说"}
[00:45.020]Knife to the throat with no hesitation
{"利刃封喉毫无迟疑"}
[00:47.190]Quick cuts and keep moving
{"速战速决持续行动"}
[00:51.030]Draw no attention while I works up front in the background
{"我在台前幕后运筹帷幄　不露痕迹"}
[00:53.450]Never one to back down
{"从不知退缩为何物"}
[00:54.940]Move up and keep using
{"步步为营持续发力"}
[00:56.180]Need god-like power to be
{"需有神祇般的力量"}
[00:57.830]Better than me
{"才能超越我"}
[00:58.620]Better to be a better me
{"成为更完美的自己"}
[01:00.940]I'd kill for that
{"我愿为此杀戮"}
[01:01.900]Elite and loyal squad
{"精锐忠勇之师"}
[01:03.180]Willing to back any play that I make
{"甘愿为我任何行动承担后果"}
[01:04.270]Spill a whole lot of blood if that's what it takes to Saves lives, take lives
{"若需拯救生命或夺取性命　不惜血流成河"}
[01:08.220]Simply prioritize
{"只需分清主次"}
[01:10.340]Got goals to achieve now open your eyes, see past the lies
{"目标亟待实现　睁开双眼看穿谎言"}
[01:22.420]Let's play it like a blood sport
{"让我们像血战竞技般行动"}
[01:24.210]Fight for your life or die
{"为生存而战或迎接死亡"}
[01:25.390]It's your choice
{"选择权在你手中"}
[01:26.410]Sometimes it capture and kill
{"有时需捕获与处决"}
[01:28.030]Squash the dissenting elements
{"镇压异议分子"}
[01:30.370]Torture the enemy, just for the hell of it
{"折磨敌人只为取乐"}
[01:32.350]Tell me to care, but I just can't
{"要我关心　但我做不到"}
[01:34.720]My patience for this has gone dark
{"对此事的耐心已消磨殆尽"}
[01:36.020]After patience then the fun starts
{"耐心耗尽后好戏才开场"}
[01:38.080]The knives and guns come out
{"刀枪纷纷出鞘"}
[01:39.690]The option for living is getting revoked
{"生存资格正被剥夺"}
[01:41.900]My squad may leave you broken
{"我的小队或许只将你击垮"}
[01:43.430]But may be me that slits your throat like a sheep or a goat
{"但割喉者可能是我　如宰杀羔羊"}
[01:46.260]Remorseless
{"毫无悔意"}
[01:47.060]The course of action is merely a by-product of my focus
{"行动轨迹不过是专注的副产品"}
[01:50.790]The closer I get
{"越是接近目标"}
[01:51.520]The more I'm willing to go beast-mode
{"越愿化身野兽形态"}
[02:02.080]Spilled guts and glory
{"散落的肠脏与荣耀"}
[02:03.780]Gory as it gets, I am that story
{"血腥至极　我即是传说本身"}
[02:06.060]Can god-like power make me a better me?
{"神赐之力能让我更完美吗？"}
[02:08.730]I just wanna see
{"我只想亲眼见证"}
